Task Requirements & Implementation Summary
Bucket Creation: Created an S3 bucket named devops-web-841761087 in the us-east-1 region.

Public Access Configuration: Disabled block public access settings (BlockPublicAcls, IgnorePublicAcls, BlockPublicPolicy, RestrictPublicBuckets) to allow public website endpoints and bucket policies.

Static Website Hosting: Enabled website hosting with index.html as the index document.

Bucket Policy: Applied a public-read JSON policy granting s3:GetObject permissions to all principals (*).

Content Deployment: Uploaded index.html from /root/ to the S3 bucket.

Verification: Validated endpoint accessibility returning HTTP 200 OK.

